{"2506550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "High Fructose", "steam_appid": 2506550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High Fructose</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A high-speed roguelite FPS where movement rules the battlefield.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall-running, dashing, double-jumping<br>fluid movement meets handcrafted and procedurally generated combat arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Fox.<br>In a world of fruit corrupted by demonic forces, slice, smash, and blast your way through.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ <strong>High-Speed Movement Combat</strong><br>Stay in motion and dominate enemies with momentum and positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍉 <strong>Demonic Fruit Enemies</strong><br>Each run brings newly mutated, twisted fruit enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔪 <strong>Manual + Auto Combat</strong><br>Control your melee weapon and everything else fires automatically. Become a storm of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌳 <strong>Handcrafted + Procedural Battlefields</strong><br>Designed spaces combined with dynamic layouts, paths, and elevation for every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥣 <strong>Recipe System</strong><br> Completing recipes gives you powerful game-changing effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 <strong>Shop &amp; Build Crafting</strong><br>Upgrade weapons and perks between waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌱 <strong>Persistent Progression (Seeds)</strong><br>Grow stronger, unlock new power, and push deeper each run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is currently in development.<br>Some systems and controls are still being refined.<br>We’re actively improving the experience based on player feedback.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High Fructose</